        "source": {
          "id": "surface-observation",
          "url": "https://science.nasa.gov/earth/facts/"
        },
        "notes": "Schematic interior based on NASA Science. NASA gives rounded sizes (1,221 km inner core, 2,300 km outer core, 2,900 km mantle, 30 km crust); here they are fitted to a 6,378 km radius as 1,221, 2,257, 2,870 and 30 km. Colors are illustrative; this is not direct interior imaging."
      },
